    "title": "Modern design, top amenities, and stunning views all features of new Easton luxury apartment building - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By 69 News ,\n1 days ago EASTON, Pa. - The property management company behind The Marquis apartments is preleasing units for its second apartment community in downtown Easton. City Center Residential announced today it is preleasing units in The Confluence, located at 140 S. 4th Street. Developers say the $70 million building will be the largest residential project in Easton’s history, followed by The Marquis. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
